design\releases\0_0_2\B_032_github_manual_push_stale_reads.md:14:Residual gap after the B-027 fix (found in the 2026-07-07 implementation audit). `restorePendingCommits` correctly restores the pending commit head from `localStorage` when a manual-push project is reopened, and new commits stack on that head (`getBranchHead` is pending-aware). But **all reads resolve the tree from the remote branch ref**, never from the pending head:
